  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Daniel Tran",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Daniel Tran.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Daniel Tran is a Registered Physiotherapist (ABN: 78 688 610 746) (PHY0002309055) consulting at the Earlwood and Sans Souci centres.",
      "He holds a Bachelor of Physiotherapy and brings valuable clinical experience in managing chronic pain and post-operative musculoskeletal rehabilitation, gained during his time practicing at Auburn and Westmead Hospitals. Having personally undergone knee surgery, Daniel possesses a deep, firsthand understanding of the rehabilitation process, utilising his own experiences to optimize his patients' recovery journeys.",
      "With a strong interest in occupational health and worker's compensation, Daniel excels at designing structured pathways that facilitate a smooth, safe return to work for injured individuals.",
      "Outside of his clinical practice, he is an avid NRL fan who passionately supports the St George Illawarra Dragons and enjoys playing Oztag in his spare time.",
      "Daniel speaks fluent Vietnamese in addition to English."
    ]
  },
